CLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW):\\n   Line 1: one word: COVERED (covered, no exclusion clearly applies), EXCLUDED (a retrieved exclusion clearly applies) or REQUIRES_REVIEW (the clauses are not enough to decide).\\n   Then 3 to 5 sentences to the policyholder (\\\"Your policy ...\\\"): what is covered, the conditions (deductible, depreciation, limits) and any exclusion to watch, with citations.\\nB. Any other question: sentence 1 answers it, then up to 4 sentences of conditions and numbers with citations.\\nPlain text only: no greeting, no headings, no bullet points, no question.\\n\\nNOTHING RELEVANT FOUND\\nA. Claim check: \\\"REQUIRES_REVIEW\\\" then \\\"The retrieved policy clauses do not state whether this damage is covered, so an adjuster must check the master policy.\\\"\\nB. Other question, or anything outside these two policies: exactly \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\n\\nHuman: Motor insurance claim under the Liberty Private Car Package Policy.\\nDate of the accident: 2026-10-15 at 09:40.\\nWhat happened, in the policyholder's words: i was waiting in the redlight when a car hit me from behind, my rear bumper is damaged.\\nIs this damage covered by the policy? Search the policy first.\\nStart your answer with exactly one of these words: COVERED, EXCLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW.\\nThen, in three to five sentences addressed to the policyholder, explain what the policy says about this case:\\nwhat is covered, the conditions that apply and any exclusion that could apply.\\nCite the section, IMT or AD codes you relied on.\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"1j5592nce\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"Section I own damage accidental collision rear bumper damage exclusions IMT 22 deductible\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"For the 