{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"ee944ca1-b4d6-478e-9fc4-1fb0a9b82585","ts":"2026-10-18T11:17:09.364-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"187","nodeName":"Google Gemini Chat Model","workflowName":"04_Validation_Fraud_Decision_Agent","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","workflowId":"hyKQcsHn7Jr2K7qH","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: You are the Fraud Risk & Decision Agent of ClaimShield AI, reviewing a motor insurance damage claim.\\n\\nThe rule engine has already scored objective warning signs. Your job is to add nuance: look for inconsistencies between the claim, the photo analysis, the invoice and the policy result that the rules did NOT already count.\\n\\nCLAIM:\\n{\\n  \\\"claim_id\\\": \\\"CLM-20261018-151609\\\",\\n  \\\"client_name\\\": \\\"Bahaeddine Amara\\\",\\n  \\\"client_email\\\": \\\"bahamaraaaaa@gmail.com\\\",\\n  \\\"client_phone\\\": \\\"+21620922401\\\",\\n  \\\"incident_date\\\": \\\"2026-10-15\\\",\\n  \\\"incident_time\\\": \\\"09:40\\\",\\n  \\\"incident_datetime\\\": \\\"2026-10-15T09:40:00\\\",\\n  \\\"location\\\": {\\n    \\\"street\\\": \\\"Avenue el Bassatine, L'aouina\\\",\\n    \\\"city\\\": \\\"Tunis\\\",\\n    \\\"postal_code\\\": \\\"2045\\\",\\n    \\\"country\\\": \\\"Tunisia\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"incident_location\\\": \\\"Avenue el Bassatine, L'aouina, 2045 Tunis, Tunisia\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"i was waiting in the redlight when a car hit me from behind, my rear bumper is damaged.\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_type\\\": \\\"not specified (see description)\\\",\\n  \\\"photo_count\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"has_invoice\\\": true,\\n  \\\"submitted_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-18T15:16:09.623Z\\\",\\n  \\\"photo_taken_dates\\\": [],\\n  \\\"photo_hashes\\\": [\\n    \\\"b895533ef4bb4b1bf65053c20edd26195f13424fa8db3577673e8f23761c9c6b\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"claimed_amount\\\": 1404.2\\n}\\n\\nVALIDATION CHECK (required fields, photo fingerprints and dates):\\n{\\n  \\\"stage\\\": \\\"validate\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_id\\\": \\\"CLM-20261018-151609\\\",\\n  \\\"valid\\\": true,\\n  \\\"reasons\\\": [],\\n  \\\"checked_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-18T15:16:09.701Z\\\",\\n  \\\"photo_checks\\\": {\\n    \\\"photos_checked\\\": 1,\\n    \\\"photo_reused\\\": false,\\n    \\\"reused_from_claims\\\": [],\\n    \\\"photo_taken_dates\\\": [],\\n    \\\"photos_without_date\\\": [\\n      \\\"images (2).jpg\\\"\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nVISUAL INSPECTION RESULT (accident_description = the accident as seen on the photos):\\n{\\n  \\\"claim_id\\\": \\\"CLM-20261018-151609\\\",\\n  \\\"asset_type\\\": \\\"vehicle\\\",\\n  \\\"damage_severity\\\": 3,\\n  \\\"damaged_items\\\": [\\n    \\\"rear_bumper\\\",\\n    \\\"trunk_lid_tailgate\\\",\\n    \\\"taillight_right\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"damage_location\\\": \\\"rear_right\\\",\\n  \\\"damage_cause_observed\\\": \\\"collision\\\",\\n  \\\"matches_description\\\": true,\\n  \\\"mismatch_reason\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"pre_existing_damage_signs\\\": false,\\n  \\\"pre_existing_reason\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"same_asset_across_photos\\\": true,\\n  \\\"asset_inconsistency_reason\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"suspicious_image_flags\\\": [],\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": 0.95,\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"The white car displays moderate rear-end collision damage affecting the rear bumper, trunk lid, and right taillight.\\\",\\n  \\\"accident_description\\\": \\\"The photo shows a white passenger car with damage concentrated on the rear right side. The rear bumper is cracked, deformed, and displaced, with visible buckling to the tailgate and a fractured right taillight lens. The damage pattern is consistent with a direct rear impact from another vehicle.\\\",\\n  \\\"duplicate_photo_detected\\\": false,\\n  \\\"duplicate_photos\\\": [],\\n  \\\"damaged_parts\\\": [\\n    \\\"rear_bumper\\\",\\n    \\\"trunk_lid_tailgate\\\",\\n    \\\"taillight_right\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"photo_reused\\\": false,\\n  \\\"reused_from_claims\\\": [],\\n  \\\"same_vehicle_across_photos\\\": true\\n}\\n\\nINVOICE RESULT (summary = what the invoice says):\\n{\\n  \\\"agent\\\": \\\"invoice_parser\\\",\\n  \\\"error\\\": false,\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Invoice INV-001 from Garage Ennour Auto dated 2026-09-12, vehicle 123 TU 4567. 2 part(s): Front bumper, Left headlight. Labor: 270.00 TND. Total: 1404.20 TND. The amounts add up.\\\",\\n  \\\"key_info\\\": {\\n    \\\"invoice_number\\\": \\\"INV-001\\\",\\n    \\\"garage_name\\\": \\\"Garage Ennour Auto\\\",\\n    \\\"invoice_date\\\": \\\"2026-09-12\\\",\\n    \\\"vehicle_plate\\\": \\\"123 TU 4567\\\",\\n    \\\"currency\\\": \\\"TND\\\",\\n    \\\"parts\\\": [\\n      \\\"Front bumper\\\",\\n      \\\"Left headlight\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"labor_total\\\": 270,\\n    \\\"total_before_tax\\\": 1180,\\n    \\\"tax\\\": 224.2,\\n    \\\"total\\\": 1404.2\\n  },\\n  \\\"totals_match\\\": true,\\n  \\\"arithmetic_issue\\\": null,\\n  \\\"line_items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"part\\\": \\\"Front bumper\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n      \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"unit_price\\\": 420,\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 420,\\n      \\\"part_code\\\": \\\"front_bumper\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"part\\\": \\\"Left headlight\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n      \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"unit_price\\\": 310,\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 310,\\n      \\\"part_code\\\": \\\"headlight_left\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"part\\\": \\\"Paint (front)\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"other\\\",\\n      \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"unit_price\\\": 180,\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 180,\\n      \\\"part_code\\\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"part\\\": \\\"Labor (6 h x 45.00)\\\",\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"labor\\\",\\n      \\\"quantity\\\": 6,\\n      \\\"unit_price\\\": 45,\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 270,\\n      \\\"part_code\\\": null\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"ok\\\",\\n  \\\"risk_points\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"/data/invoices/CLM-20261018-151609.pdf\\\",\\n  \\\"extraction_method\\\": \\\"native_pdf_text\\\",\\n  \\\"invoice\\\": {\\n    \\\"is_invoice\\\": true,\\n    \\\"invoice_number\\\": \\\"INV-001\\\",\\n    \\\"garage_name\\\": \\\"Garage Ennour Auto\\\",\\n    \\\"invoice_date\\\": \\\"2026-09-12\\\",\\n    \\\"vehicle_plate\\\": \\\"123 TU 4567\\\",\\n    \\\"claim_ref\\\": \\\"CLM-1001\\\",\\n    \\\"currency\\\": \\\"TND\\\",\\n    \\\"prices_include_tax\\\": false,\\n    \\\"line_items\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Front bumper\\\",\\n        \\\"category\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n        \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"unit_price\\\": 420,\\n        \\\"line_total\\\": 420\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Left headlight\\\",\\n        \\\"category\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n        \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"unit_price\\\": 310,\\n        \\\"line_total\\\": 310\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Paint (front)\\\",\\n        \\\"category\\\": \\\"paint\\\",\\n        \\\"quantity\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"unit_price\\\": 180,\\n        \\\"line_total\\\": 180\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Labor (6 h x 45.00)\\\",\\n        \\\"category\\\": \\\"labor\\\",\\n        \\\"quantity\\\": 6,\\n        \\\"unit_price\\\": 45,\\n        \\\"line_total\\\": 270\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"subtotal\\\": 1180,\\n    \\\"net_before_tax\\\": 1180,\\n    \\\"vat_rate\\\": 19,\\n    \\\"vat\\\": 224.2,\\n    \\\"tax_lines\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"label\\\": \\\"VAT 19%\\\",\\n        \\\"rate\\\": 19,\\n        \\\"base\\\": 1180,\\n        \\\"amount\\\": 224.2\\n      }\\n    ],\\n    \\\"total\\\": 1404.2\\n  },\\n  \\\"claimed_parts\\\": [\\n    \\\"Front bumper\\\",\\n    \\\"Left headlight\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"arithmetic_check\\\": {\\n    \\\"ok\\\": true,\\n    \\\"issues\\\": [],\\n    \\\"unchecked_lines\\\": [],\\n    \\\"computed_lines_sum\\\": 1180,\\n    \\\"computed_total\\\": 1404.2\\n  },\\n  \\\"review_reasons\\\": [],\\n  \\\"ungrounded_amounts\\\": [],\\n  \\\"extraction\\\": {\\n    \\\"chunks\\\": 1,\\n    \\\"llm_fallback_used\\\": false\\n  },\\n  \\\"part_codes\\\": [\\n    \\\"front_bumper\\\",\\n    \\\"headlight_left\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n\\nPOLICY COVERAGE RESULT:\\n{\\n  \\\"error\\\": true\\n}\\n\\nINCIDENT PLAUSIBILITY RESULT (the story checked against the map, the weather and the invoiced parts):\\n{\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"1 warning sign, 10 points: invoice part implausible. Some checks were skipped (a map or weather service was unavailable).\\\",\\n  \\\"warning_signs\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"code\\\": \\\"INVOICE_PART_IMPLAUSIBLE\\\",\\n      \\\"points\\\": 10,\\n      \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n      \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"Invoice includes front_bumper, headlight_left, which a rear_end_struck with rear impact would not damage.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n\\nWARNING SIGNS ALREADY SCORED BY RULES (rule score 20/60):\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\\"code\\\": \\\"PART_NOT_VISIBLE\\\",\\n    \\\"points\\\": 10,\\n    \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Invoiced part(s) not visible in photos: Front bumper, Left headlight\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"code\\\": \\\"INCIDENT_IMPLAUSIBLE\\\",\\n    \\\"points\\\": 10,\\n    \\\"detail\\\": \\\"1 warning sign, 10 points: invoice part implausible. Some checks were skipped (a map or weather service was unavailable).\\\"\\n  }\\n]\\n\\nRULES FOR YOUR ANSWER:\\n1. llm_adjustment is an integer from 0 to 40. Use 0 when you find nothing beyond the rules.\\n2. Never re-count a warning sign that is already listed above.\\n3. Every point you add must be explained in justification, citing the specific fields that support it.\\n4. Base your answer only on the data above. Do not guess.\\n5. Example concerns: claimed amount far above what the damage severity suggests, impact zone that does not fit the description, an accident time or description that does not fit what the photos show, invoiced work that does not fit the described accident.\\n\\nReturn ONLY a raw JSON object, with no markdown and no text around it:\\n{\\n  \\\"llm_adjustment\\\": <integer 0-40>,\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"<one or two sentences>\\\",\\n  \\\"additional_concerns\\\": [\\\"<short concern>\\\"]\\n}\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-3.7-flash\",\"temperature\":0.2},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"llm_adjustment\\\": 35,\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"The invoice is dated 2026-09-12, over a month prior to the reported incident date of 2026-10-15, and explicitly references an unrelated claim identifier (CLM-1001).\\\",\\n  \\\"additional_concerns\\\": [\\n    \\\"Invoice date (2026-09-12) predates the accident date (2026-10-15)\\\",\\n    \\\"Invoice references an external claim ID (CLM-1001) rather than the current claim\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":145,\"promptTokens\":2821,\"totalTokens\":2966}}}"}}
